{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the documented manual callback API.** `context.create_callback()` still returns a public `Callback` whose `.result()` waits for completion. The absolute statement that there is no `callback.result()` can cause users of manual callback flows to remove the required wait; restrict this statement to the value returned by `wait_for_callback()`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7o8Jsz","finding_digest":"7705ad81f83f3bde70657d1254bb4547c9feaaac29e8cdf14710309f0adb0d97","finding_id":"arf_v1_o4c23apyh45544dfpujfjo2fi7","finding_key":"docs/migration-1.x-to-2.x.md::callback-result::create-callback-api-preserved","identity_key":"docs/migration-1.x-to-2.x.md::callback-result::create-callback-api-preserved","line":241,"observation_digest":"08954d083af340b64c83f0063600e1760f3730bdb9626de8b254fffa2a720daf","observation_id":"aro_v1_bcku2cb26nalmted6addmahboy","path":"docs/migration-1.x-to-2.x.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T20:20:57Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6q22ccaf2z5sttphbjnlbskryq","reviewed_base_sha":"ae73e73a9749d8faf73fc5530ce0429a70a5a725","reviewed_head_sha":"ea3ae4884dcd84d9c1d47eb03121c61c437f7f6e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":240,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_auagoyldyyvrdetlqizs7qwgn6"},"pull_request":{"number":655},"record_id":"art_v1_smtdsadkcjnby2cyv5s4ukyfzd","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T20:20:57Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
